@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam PackageBorderColor #9ca3af

title FindCare: three pages and their members — which the tool registry and the running code actually carry

legend top right
|<#dcfce7>   | declared in the tool registry and dispatched by running code |
|<#fef3c7>   | the work happens, but no tool is declared/dispatched for it |
|<#fee2e2>   | declared, and the file that would serve it is imported by nothing |
|<#e5e7eb>   | no tool, no endpoint |
endlegend

package "Find an individual care giver\npage: individualProvider" {
  component "ProviderSearch (required)\nsearch\n/provider/find" as PS #dcfce7
  component "SpecialtyFilter\nNUCC/specialty chooser\n/specialty/find\nmacro-toggles: Prescribers | Homeopathic" as SF #dcfce7
  component "Geo\ngeography resolver (page-scoped)\nparallel to SpecialtyFilter" as PGeo #fef3c7
  component "ProviderDetail\ndetail\n/provider-detail" as PD #dcfce7
  component "ProviderSelection\nselection\nprovider_selection" as PSel #dcfce7
}

package "Find a facility\npage: facility" {
  component "FacilitySearch (required)\nsearch\n/facility/find" as FS #dcfce7
  component "facility NUCC filter\nNUCC/kinds chooser\ninside /facility/find\nmacro-toggles: Ambulatory | Psychiatric | Inpatient" as FVoc #fef3c7
  component "Geo\ngeography resolver (page-scoped)\nparallel to the facility NUCC filter" as FGeo #fef3c7
  component "FacilityDetail\ndetail\n/provider-detail (entity_type '2')" as FD #dcfce7
  component "FacilitySelection\nselection\nfacility_selection" as FSel #dcfce7
}

package "Find a clinical trial\npage: clinicalTrial" {
  component "ClinicalTrials (required)\nsearch\n/trial/find" as CT #dcfce7
  component "condition wording\nvocabulary chooser\nmining prompt only" as CVoc #e5e7eb
  component "trial detail\ndetail" as CD #e5e7eb
  component "ClinicalTrialSelection\nselection\nclinical_trial_selection" as CSel #dcfce7
}

component "facility_search_tool.py\nshipped, imported by nothing" as FSdead #fee2e2
component "GeoExtractorTool\ndeclared, zero call sites" as GEdead #fee2e2

FS .right. FSdead
PGeo .down. GEdead

' Stack the three subjects vertically so the grid reads page-by-page, not as one flat list.
PS -[hidden]down- FS
FS -[hidden]down- CT

note bottom of SF
  The individual page's chooser funnels the utterance
  onto the Individual NUCC partition. Its macro-toggles
  Prescribers and Homeopathic are the pattern the
  facility NUCC filter mirrors.
end note

note bottom of PGeo
  Geo is a page-scoped member on individualProvider and
  facility (current iteration), running parallel to the
  specialty/NUCC chooser; it resolves free-text
  geography including misspellings. No dispatched tool
  serves it today: the declared GeoExtractorTool has
  zero call sites, and the resolution is a live model
  call in the shared library (geo_extractor.py). That
  shared-library placement is BUG-003 / the C5 §2.7
  boundary question (N27). The built registry instance
  (build 2292) lists Geo differently across pages; the
  current iteration scopes it to these two pages.
end note

note bottom of FVoc
  Current iteration: the facility page carries a NUCC
  filter with Ambulatory / Psychiatric / Inpatient
  macro-toggles, mirroring the individual page's
  Prescribers / Homeopathic filter. As built today the
  kinds are resolved by the same SpecialtyFilter funnel
  on the Non-Individual partition, called from
  _facility_kinds inside the search route. Because it
  is not a tool, no requirement can be stated against
  it: offeredFacilityTypes and selectedTaxonomyCodes
  are declared against FacilitySearch instead, so the
  chooser cannot be asked for on its own. The built
  registry instance (build 2292) does not yet list this
  filter member.
end note

note bottom of CVoc
  The trial page turns words into a condition string
  inside its mining prompt. Nothing intersects the
  answer with a catalogue, so unlike the NUCC funnel
  there is no registry fact the model is held to.
end note

note bottom of CD
  openNctId is declared and the page records which
  trial is on screen, but no tool and no route serve a
  trial detail: the React widget paints it from the
  search result it already cached.
  EPIC-006-F-004-S-001 is the gap.
end note

note right of FSdead
  Nothing imports it. The router posts straight to the
  /facility/find URL, so the file ships into the
  SharedServices container on every deploy and no code
  path reaches it.
end note

note bottom of FD
  Declared as its own tool, served by the
  ProviderDetail tool with entity_type "2". There is
  no facility_detail_tool.py; the declaration names an
  endpoint two tools share.
end note

@enduml
